---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import Circle from '../components/Circle.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="PRIVACY" description="How Original handles data: no accounts, no tracking, no cookies.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1 class="page-title"><Circle /> PRIVACY</h1>
    <p class="lede">What this site does and does not collect. Last updated 2026-11-04.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="prose legal-prose">
    <p>
      Original is a static website. It has no accounts, no comment system, no advertising, and no
      analytics or tracking scripts. Reading the site does not require a cookie.
    </p>

    <h2>SERVER LOGS</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may process standard request data — such as IP
      address, user agent, requested URL, and timestamps — to deliver the site and protect its
      infrastructure. That processing is governed by GitHub's privacy statement, not by Original.
    </p>

    <h2>EMAIL</h2>
    <p>
      Messages sent to <a href="mailto:contact@original.wales">contact@original.wales</a> or
      <a href="mailto:security@original.wales">security@original.wales</a> are forwarded to the
      maintainer's mailbox through ImprovMX. The content of a message is used to answer it and is
      not published without permission. Email providers process the message under their own terms.
    </p>

    <h2>TOOLS</h2>
    <p>
      The checksum, JSON, license comparison, and license chooser tools run in the browser. Files
      and text entered into them are not uploaded to this site. The browser may still request
      static assets from the same origin; those requests are ordinary web requests.
    </p>

    <h2>EXTERNAL LINKS</h2>
    <p>
      Following an external link takes you to a site with its own privacy practices. Original does
      not control those sites and does not receive data from them.
    </p>

    <h2>CONTACT</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this page: <a href="mailto:contact@original.wales">contact@original.wales</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
